  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1016036_all.svg\" alt=\"可用版本\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1016036?logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fricks-portal-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ricks-portal-gun-fabric?logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mPFZqXpcFF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/981900104871055430?logo=discord&label=Discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ricks-portal-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>想要帮助将模组翻译成其他语言？现在你可以在我们的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252feditor%252fricks-portal-gun%252fall%253fview%253dmultilingual%2526languages%253dfr%252cenud%252czhcn%252cja%252clol%252cenpt%252ces%252cru\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin 页面</a> 上进行翻译！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组添加了热门剧集《瑞克和莫蒂》中的传送门枪。你可以使用它来创建传送门，前往你希望的任何维度中的任意位置。要选择一个目的地，请按 V 键（可更改）并输入坐标和维度 ID，例如 minecraft:overworld 或 minecraft:the_nether。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;对于模组添加的维度，请使用 mod_id:dimension_name 格式</p>\n<p>特别感谢 TheMajorNoob_239 和 Gol D. Crow 在素材方面的帮助，以及 SamTees 在代码方面的协助。</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0wKFDh2WvD0\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>预告片由 HeyHey37 制作</p>\n<p>请注意，1.21（pre-1.4 更新）版本的流体合成表有所不同：&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1016036/description_9fe7b8d5-b1d6-443d-901a-4a627a39b84f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"433\" height=\"214\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1016036/description_799e53cd-3767-4953-8ea1-418216d4a4ed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"245\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>合成表（pre-1.4 更新前）：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>传送门枪</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://jacobempire.uk/dev/dalekmodaddons/images/james/recipe 1.png\" width=\"448\" height=\"233\"></p>\n<p>高级传送门枪</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://jacobempire.uk/dev/dalekmodaddons/images/james/recipe2.png\" width=\"419\" height=\"212\"></p>\n<p>黄金传送门枪</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://jacobempire.uk/dev/dalekmodaddons/images/james/recipe3.png\" width=\"423\" height=\"217\"></p>\n<p>量子跃迁灵药 = 紫颂果 + 中毒药水</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://jacobempire.uk/dev/dalekmodaddons/images/james/recipe5.png\" width=\"405\" height=\"245\"></p>\n<p>仿制传送门流体 = 末影之眼 + 浓稠药水</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://jacobempire.uk/dev/dalekmodaddons/images/james/recipe6.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"233\"></p>\n<p>传送门流体 = 仿制传送门流体 + 量子跃迁灵药</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://jacobempire.uk/dev/dalekmodaddons/images/james/recipe4.png\" width=\"399\" height=\"455\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>正在寻找可以游玩此模组的服务器？多亏 BisectHosting，你可以实现！只需加入 <strong>dolphin.modded.fun</strong> 并安装我们官方最新的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/ricks-portal-gun-official-server-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合包</a>。想要自己搭建服务器？可以从 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fdolphin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a> 获取！使用优惠码 <strong>dolphin</strong> 可享受 25% 折扣！</p>\n<p><strong>如果你有任何问题或建议，请加入 Discord！</strong> 在那里你将获得更快速、更好的支持。</p>",
